# ADIVA — End-to-End Architecture & Deep Dive

## 1. What is ADIVA?

**ADIVA** (**A**utomated **D**ata **I**ntelligence and **V**alidation **A**gent) is an AI-powered document extraction and validation pipeline. You upload a document (PDF, DOCX, image) → it extracts structured data using OCR + LLM → then the Validation Agent quality-checks and normalises the output.

