### 5.5 Confidence Scorer ([confidence_scorer.py](file:///c:/Users/JapanKachhiya/ADIVA-Automated-Data-Intelligence-and-Validation-Agent/backend/confidence_scorer.py))

Calculates a **multi-metric confidence** score with these dimensions:

| Metric | Weight | What it measures |
|--------|--------|-----------------|
| `schema_completeness` | High | % of required fields present |
| `data_quality` | High | Valid formats, non-null values |
| `field_confidence` | Medium | Per-field extraction confidence |
| `consistency` | Medium | Logical consistency (e.g., totals match) |
| `ocr_quality` | Low | OCR-specific quality (if applicable) |

Output: `{overall: 0.892, grade: "B+", explanations: [...], recommendations: [...]}`

