## 7. Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|----------|-----------|
| **Mistral AI** as the LLM | Cost-effective, fast, strong JSON output adherence |
| **21 document schemas** | Covers the most common Indian administrative + business documents |
| **3-backend table extraction** | pdfplumber is fastest but misses complex layouts; camelot handles scanned tables; tabula is a final fallback |
| **2-tier OCR** | Tesseract is fast for printed text; EasyOCR (deep learning) handles handwriting when Tesseract confidence < 60% |
| **Validation Agent as a separate service** | Decoupled from extraction — can validate external data too |
| **4 output formats** | JSON for APIs, CSV for spreadsheets, Excel for business users, HTML for browser viewing |
| **Pydantic everywhere** | Strict schema enforcement for both API responses and audit reports |

